| Stripe | mode live/test (keys must match) · `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY` (`sk_`/`rk_`), `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`, `STRIPE_CONNECT_WEBHOOK_SECRET` · publishable key, Connect `ca_` id · manual: return URLs on www.floqr.app, Connect platform profile |
| Firebase Auth | manual only: disable Email/Password, authorized domains www.floqr.app + apex, SMS region US+CA |
| Azure | subscription / tenant / resource group / SWA name / DNS zone · GitHub secret `AZURE_STATIC_WEB_APPS_API_TOKEN` · manual: custom domains www / admin / master / staging, apex 301 |
| Domain | canonical origin `https://www.floqr.app`, admin / master / staging hosts, reCAPTCHA site key · env `FLOQR_PUBLIC_ORIGIN`, `FLOQR_DISPLAY_BASE_URL` (**cutover day only** — leave empty while Pages is staging) · manual: OAuth redirects, App Check |
| floqCast TURN | env `FLOQCAST_TURN_URLS` · secrets `FLOQCAST_TURN_USERNAME`, `FLOQCAST_TURN_CREDENTIAL` |
| Display token signer | runtime service account · manual: `roles/iam.serviceAccountTokenCreator` |
| POS | Square / Toast / SpotOn / Clover: app or client ids + environment (env `POS_*`), secrets `POS_*_SECRET` / webhook keys (names from `reports/vip-pos-integrations.md`) · manual: redirect URIs on www.floqr.app |
