| Meta Business | business id, WhatsApp Business Account id, display name · manual: business verification |

Fields marked `readByCodeToday: false` (Connect, TURN, POS, TSA, App Check key, SWA token) are stored ahead of the code that will read them; wire `defineSecret` with the same name when that feature ships.

## Never

- Commit `config/accounts-profile.local.json` or paste its values into chat, commits, issues, or logs.
- Put a secret value in argv, stdout, Firestore, or `functions/.env` (the script refuses secret-looking values on non-secret targets).
- Run `--apply` against production from an agent session without the owner's explicit go-ahead.
- Read existing `functions/.env` values in an agent session (key names only).

